    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #291\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-266-review-debt-01-12-bound-the-imap-conne-thr_dk5vhsqhfn`.\n\n## Summary\n\nAddressed code-review feedback on PR #291: moved the regression test from a standalone file into `mailSync.test.ts` (next to the existing per-account IMAP concurrency limiter tests) and adjusted it to queue exactly three waiting tasks before the limit-raise call, matching the issue's specified scenario.\n\nThe remote branch had been updated with a merge from `develop` since my last push, so I rebased my new commit on top of it before pushing — no conflicts.\n\n**Verification after rebase:** full backend test suite passes (25 files, 316 tests), and `pnpm -r run build` (tsc across all 7 backend packages) is clean.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
